#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.audex.appdata.xml:9
msgid ""
"Audex is an CD ripper application. It lets you extract the audio from your "
"CD-ROMs to let you listen to them on your computer and your other devices. "
"It includes a CDDB and a MusicBrainz integration to fetch the metadata and "
"covers for your CD-ROMs if available."
msgstr ""

